{
  "file_id": "3594",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 52,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Hey, Izzy. Why'd you want to\nreturn to the factory all of a\nsudden?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 1928,
      "_bytes": 72,
      "translation": "Oye, Izzy. ¿Por qué querías\nvolver a la fábrica de\nrepente?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "I'm sorry... But my computer\nsuddenly hasn't been working as\nwell.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2001,
      "_bytes": 66,
      "translation": "Lo siento... Es que mi\nordenador de repente va\nfatal."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "I need replacement parts.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2068,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "Me hacen falta recambios."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "So you're gonna look for them at\nthe factory?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2094,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "¿Y vais a buscarlos a la\nfábrica?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "If there's a replacement kit\nthere, he can replace the parts he\nneeds.",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2140,
      "_bytes": 70,
      "translation": "Si allí hay un kit de\nrecambio, podrá cambiar las\npiezas que necesita."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "If we don't hurry, I'll lose all\nmy important data. Let's go!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2211,
      "_bytes": 61,
      "translation": "Si no nos damos prisa,\nperderé mis datos. ¡Vamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Ah... and there they go.",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2273,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "Ah... y allá van."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Can't be helped. Let's go after\nthem.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2298,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "Qué remedio. Vamos tras\nellos."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Hmm... Ah! If it's this kind of\npart, I can replace it with\nthis...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2336,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "Hmm... ¡Ah! Si es esta pieza,\npuedo cambiarla por\nesta..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Papa!",
      "speaker_id": 2312,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2404,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Papá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Gah! Why is there a Yokomon here?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2410,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¡Ah! ¿Qué hace aquí un Yokomon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Are you lost?",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2445,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¿Te perdiste?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Papa! Papa!",
      "speaker_id": 2312,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2459,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Papá! ¡Papá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Papa? Me?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2471,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¿Papá? ¿Yo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "It's taken quite the liking to\nyou, Izzy.",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2481,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "Le has caído muy bien, Izzy."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "I think it's like when a chick\nsees its parent for the first\ntime. \"Imprinting\", I believe?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2528,
      "_bytes": 91,
      "translation": "Creo que es como cuando un\npolluelo ve a su padre por\nprimera vez. \"Impronta\", ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Yokomon is lost! Help me, Papa!",
      "speaker_id": 2312,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2620,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Yokomon se perdió!\n¡Ayuda, papá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "This is quite troublesome...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2653,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "Esto es un problema..."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Option A",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2682,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "Opción A"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Take it back to the village.",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2691,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "Llevarlo de nuevo al pueblo."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "From Option A to the next event",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2720,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "De la opción A al evento"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Option B",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2752,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "Opción B"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Find the replacement parts first.",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2761,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Buscar primero las piezas."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Tai, is it open?",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2795,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Tai, ¿se abre?"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "No way...!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2815,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Qué va...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "What's wrong?",
      "speaker_id": 2312,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2826,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¿Qué pasa?"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "The open and close system for the\ndoor seems to be broken. If I fix\nit...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2840,
      "_bytes": 73,
      "translation": "El sistema de apertura de la\npuerta está roto. Si lo\narreglo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "That's...!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2914,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Eso es...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "What's up, Izzy?",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2925,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¿Qué pasa, Izzy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "The internal parts are\ncorrupted...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2947,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "Las piezas internas están\ndañadas..."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "No way!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2983,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Yes... I can fix it if I use the\nparts I got a while ago, but...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 2991,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "Sí... Puedo arreglarlo con\nlas piezas de antes, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "...then you can't fix your\ncomputer!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3056,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "...¡y no podrás\narreglar tu PC!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Izzy...",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3093,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "Izzy..."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "It's an obvious choice!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3106,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡Está clarísimo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "All right, let's go back!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3130,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Muy bien, volvamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Izzy...",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3156,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "Izzy..."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Hey, everyone! Yokomon came back!",
      "speaker_id": 2312,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3169,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¡Eh, chicos! ¡Yokomon ha vuelto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Looks like they came to look for\ntheir friend.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3204,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "Parece que vinieron a buscar\na su amigo."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Thanks, Papa!",
      "speaker_id": 2312,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3251,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Gracias, papá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "It's no trouble at all!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3265,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡No ha sido nada!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Here's a gift of thanks from\nYokomon's friends! Yokomon will\ngive it to you, Papa!",
      "speaker_id": 2312,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3289,
      "_bytes": 84,
      "translation": "¡Un regalo de los amigos de\nYokomon! ¡Yokomon te lo da,\npapá!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Oh, you didn't have to... thank\nyou.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3374,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "Oh, no hacía falta...\ngracias."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "But it's a shame, after all the\neffort we put in to find those\nparts...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3411,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "Pero qué pena, con lo que\nnos costó encontrar esas\npiezas..."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "It's certainly a shame... but\nwe'll go look for them again.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3483,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "Sí que es una pena... pero\nlas buscaremos otra vez."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Parts? What are those?",
      "speaker_id": 2313,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3543,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¿Piezas? ¿Qué es eso?"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Huh? Well, they look like this...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3566,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¿Eh? Pues son así..."
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Oh! A lot of things like those\nfell from the factory!",
      "speaker_id": 2313,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3600,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "¡Oh! ¡Cayeron muchas cosas\ncomo esas de la fábrica!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "What?! Really?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3654,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¿Qué? ¿En serio?"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "There's a whole load of 'em!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3669,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Hay un montón de ellas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Isn't that great, Papa?",
      "speaker_id": 2312,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3698,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¿No es genial, papá?"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Isn't that great, Izzy?",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 3722,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¿No es genial, Izzy?"
    }
  ]
}